---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import slickShot from "../assets/projects/slickonboard-app.png";
import ouShot from "../assets/projects/ourinneruniverse.png";
import tinkleShot from "../assets/projects/tinkletreeco.png";
import sureskuShot from "../assets/projects/suresku.png";

const nmabParagraphs = [
  "I originally built this for CDL schools. If someone calls while everyone's busy, the system responds automatically and keeps the conversation moving instead of letting that lead disappear into voicemail.",
  "It handles missed calls, follow-ups, booking, reminders, and review requests.",
  "I built the product, set up the automations, dealt with the Twilio compliance process, formed the company behind it, and got the first customers using it.",
];

const outboundParagraphs = [
  "The raw data was messy. Businesses were duplicated, emails were missing, and the provider's \"verified\" emails weren't as verified as I expected.",
  "So I built a pipeline that filters the list first, uses AI where the decision is less obvious, finds emails, and then checks those emails independently before they go anywhere near a sending campaign.",
  "One useful thing I found: on one batch of 11,298 contacts, the vendor's own \"verified\" label was only right 59.4% of the time.",
  "That was the whole point of building the extra verification step.",
];
---

<section id="work" class="scroll-mt-16 border-b border-[var(--border)] py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-[var(--border)] pb-4">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[var(--text)] md:text-[44px]">
        Selected work
      </h2>
      <span class="font-mono-ui text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)] uppercase">05 projects</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-11 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <a
        id="p-nmab"
        href="#case-flagship"
        class="group flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col gap-5 border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--ink)] p-8 text-[var(--ink-text)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--ink-accent)] md:p-10"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl font-medium md:text-4xl">NeverMissABooking&trade;</h3>
          <span class="font-mono-ui text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--ink-text-muted)] uppercase">Read the case study &rarr;</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-[var(--ink-text)] md:text-2xl">
          A system for businesses that miss calls and lose customers because of it.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          {
            nmabParagraphs.map((text) => (
              <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink-text-muted)]">{text}</p>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 pt-1">
          <span class="font-medium text-[var(--ink-text)]">4 clients</span>
          <span class="font-medium text-[var(--ink-text)]">$1,200/month in recurring revenue</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
          {["GoHighLevel", "Claude", "Twilio", "Python"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="font-mono-ui border border-[var(--ink-border)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-[var(--ink-text-muted)]">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        id="p-outbound"
        href="#case"
        class="group flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col gap-5 border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-8 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--accent)] md:p-10"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl font-medium text-[var(--text)] md:text-4xl">Outbound Lead Pipeline</h3>
          <span class="font-mono-ui text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)] uppercase">Read the case study &rarr;</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-[var(--text)] md:text-2xl">
          I had a big list of businesses. The problem was figuring out which contacts were actually safe to email.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          {
            outboundParagraphs.map((text) => (
              <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]">{text}</p>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 pt-1">
          <span class="font-medium text-[var(--text)]">11,298 contacts checked</span>
          <span class="font-medium text-[var(--text)]">60 sending inboxes</span>
          <span class="font-medium text-[var(--text)]">16% reply rate on the corrected list</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
          {["Python", "Outscraper", "MillionVerifier", "Claude"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="font-mono-ui border border-[var(--border)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <a
          id="p-slickonboard"
          href="https://slickonboard.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="group flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)]"
        >
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--border)]">
            <Image src={slickShot} alt="SlickOnboard marketing homepage" width={800} height={500} class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-6">
            <h4 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-[var(--text)]">SlickOnboard</h4>
            <p class="font-medium text-sm text-[var(--text)]">I got tired of doing the same client onboarding steps over and over.</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]">
              So I built a system for it. Once a client signs up, the
              onboarding flow collects what it needs and sets up the
              workspace without someone having to chase the client through
              email. It's been used for 40+ onboardings so far.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-0.5">
              {["n8n", "OpenAI", "Supabase"].map((tag) => (
                <span class="font-mono-ui border border-[var(--border)] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
                  {tag}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          id="p-inner-universe"
          href="https://ourinneruniverse.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="group flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)]"
        >
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--border)]">
            <Image src={ouShot} alt="Our Inner Universe homepage" width={800} height={500} class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-6">
            <h4 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-[var(--text)]">Our Inner Universe</h4>
            <p class="font-medium text-sm text-[var(--text)]">I wanted to see if I could build thousands of useful pages without writing thousands of pages.</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]">
              The answer was yes, but it took more work than just asking AI
              to generate content. I built the data structure and
              page-generation system behind the site, then worked through
              the problem of making thousands of pages actually useful and
              distinct. The site now has 7,000+ pages and brings in organic
              traffic.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-0.5">
              {["Astro", "Claude", "Programmatic SEO"].map((tag) => (
                <span class="font-mono-ui border border-[var(--border)] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
                  {tag}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          id="p-tinkletree"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/TinkleTree-Premium-Spiritual-Mandala-Chime/dp/B0FPWTWJQ5"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="group flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)]"
        >
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--border)]">
            <Image src={tinkleShot} alt="TinkleTree Co product listing on Amazon" width={800} height={500} class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 p-6">
            <h4 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-[var(--text)]">TinkleTree Co</h4>
            <p class="font-medium text-sm text-[var(--text)]">I built and launched my own product brand.</p>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]">
              That meant doing a bit of everything: the product, supplier
              conversations, packaging, listings, the storefront, Amazon,
              email flows, and trying to get people to actually buy it. The
              automated email flows now contribute roughly 24% of monthly
              revenue.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-0.5">
              {["Shopify", "Klaviyo", "Amazon"].map((tag) => (
                <span class="font-mono-ui border border-[var(--border)] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
                  {tag}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a
      id="p-suresku"
      href="https://suresku.com/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="group mt-6 flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col overflow-hidden border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] sm:flex-row"
    >
      <div class="aspect-[12/5] shrink-0 overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--border)] sm:aspect-auto sm:w-[42%] sm:border-r sm:border-b-0">
        <Image src={sureskuShot} alt="sureSKU Amazon review-mining dashboard" width={800} height={330} class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center gap-2.5 p-7">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-[var(--text)]">sureSKU</h3>
          <span class="font-mono-ui shrink-0 text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--accent)] uppercase">Beta</span>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-[56ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]">
          Reads every Amazon review in a category, sorts the top complaints,
          and shows private-label sellers which product gaps they can
          actually win.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-0.5">
          {["Amazon FBA", "Review mining"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="font-mono-ui border border-[var(--border)] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
